      198.86,
      215.77,
      358.02,
      240.11
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO REPEAL THE ONLINE SAFETY ACT, NO. 9 OF 2024",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.3,
      254.77,
      399.61,
      279.11
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.3,
      293.77,
      399.6,
      318.11
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Online Safety (Repeal) Act, No. of 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.3,
      332.77,
      399.59,
      357.11
    ],
    "text": "2. The Online Safety Act, No. 9 of 2024 is hereby repealed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.3,
      371.77,
      399.6,
      409.11
    ],
    "text": "3. Any regulations made under the Online Safety Act, No. 9 of 2024, after its enactment, shall be repealed from the date of enactment of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.3,
      425.77,
      399.65,
      450.11
    ],
    "text": "4. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
